# Raw corpora refetch; the derived receipts do not, because the source moves.
#
# Per webprobes/doctrine/condensed-receipts.md: the source is three EIA bulk archives and
# one NREL CSV, 1.1 GB together and all re-fetchable by the harvesters in ../scripts, so
# none of it is committed. The receipts below are the evidence for the figures -- 3.9 MB
# against 1.1 GB -- and without them nothing here can be checked or redrawn. All thirteen
# figures redraw from these with the source absent, verified by removing it.
#
# Exclude the directory's contents, then name what stays. A glob would silently admit
# whatever the next fetch happens to leave here.
*
!.gitignore
!eba-annual.json
!eba-hourly.json
!eba-skill.json
!geo.json
!predictors.json
!price.json
!seds-electrification.json
# 776 KB. The fold of 500,544 ATB rows, and the only receipt for figures 9, 10 and 11.
!atb-folded.json
# 1.7 MB and above the usual bar, argued for rather than let through: it is the whole
# PeeringDB facility directory as fetched, the only receipt for the two compute nulls in
# figures 3 and 4, and the register is voluntary -- a refetch does not reproduce it.
!peeringdb-fac.json
